flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. In a folder the link glyph by the title opens<br/>Share.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. On: the link with Copy, and Share where the<br/>system has a share sheet.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Copy says 'Copied'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. Share with a password: 'Use at least 8<br/>characters.' sits under the field before Set; a<br/>shorter one then says 'A share password needs<br/>at least 8 characters.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. Set: Locked with Change and Remove; Expires<br/>Never, 1, 7 or 30 days with the end date; 'Not<br/>opened yet'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. The visitor gets the folder name and Password;<br/>a wrong one says 'Wrong password.'; the right<br/>one shows the cards with a search.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. On a phone the visitor page is the same.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. Share with a link off asks 'Stop sharing?';<br/>afterwards the visitor sees 'This link does not<br/>work.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S9["9. Locking a shared folder ends its link, and the<br/>lock sheet says so.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
  S8 --> S9
